  "question": {
    "text": "A rectangular solid box of length <math><mn>0.3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is held horizontally, with one of its sides on the edge of a platform of height <math><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> . When released, it slips off the table in a very short time <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> , remaining essentially horizontal. The angle by which it would rotate when it hits the ground will be (in radians) close to:<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0186_310705e33e0c.png\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>0.5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
